Date: Fri, 31 Jul 2026 23:08:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix broken Industry Track links in platform hub

- Healthcare: strategist/exec-portal pointed to nonexistent
  hc-strategist.html / hc-executive-portal.html; corrected to
  healthcare/hc-main-strategist.html and healthcare/executive-portal.html
- FinOps: all three links missing the finops-war/ subfolder where
  the actual files live (finops-suite/finops-war/finops-*.html)
- Real Estate: exec portal pointed to reo-pro/re-executive-portal.html
  (wrong folder + wrong filename); corrected to
  war-rooms/re-war/re-exec-portal.html
- Schools: all three links pointed to a nonexistent top-level
  schools-command/ folder; corrected to war-rooms/schools-command/

Verified all 27 Industry Track links resolve to real files on disk.
Insurance, Construction, Legal, BPO, and Mortgage were already correct.
